  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "intro-1",
      "sectionId": "intro",
      "text": "Morning light lands on the bakery picture window.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro-2",
      "sectionId": "intro",
      "text": "A to Z brings shapes, swirls, crumbs, and names into the glow.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-A",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "Look—A! Look—Angel Cake! Angel Cake in our sight | layer, crumb, or topping gives the clue just right",
      "targetId": "A",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-B",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "B lands on Brownie. A brownie is a dense flat chocolate cake-bar often cut into squares or rectangles.",
      "targetId": "B",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-C",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "Cupcake? Yes—C. Cupcake in its cup | crumb below, little topping up",
      "targetId": "C",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-D",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "along the morning bakery display, the D clue is Danish. A Danish pastry shows flaky folded or layered dough, often surrounding a visible filling.",
      "targetId": "D",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-E",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "Say E, then Eclair. Eclair on display | crust, fold, swirl, or shape gives the clue today",
      "targetId": "E",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-F",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "Look—F! Look—Frosting! It is a thick spreadable topping that can form swirls or smooth layers on cakes.",
      "targetId": "F",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-G",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "G lands on Glaze. Glaze is a thin smooth coating that dries shiny or translucent over a baked item.",
      "targetId": "G",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-H",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "Honey Bun? Yes—H. It is a soft coiled or rolled sweet bun often finished with a thin glaze.",
      "targetId": "H",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-I",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "along the morning bakery display, the I clue is Icing. Icing on top | texture, dots, or shine make the picture pop",
      "targetId": "I",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-J",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "Say J, then Jelly Donut. It is a filled round donut with fruit jelly or jam inside.",
      "targetId": "J",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-K",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "Look—K! Look—Kolache! It is a small yeasted pastry with a visible center or enclosed filling, depending on style.",
      "targetId": "K",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-L",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "L lands on Loaf. A loaf is bread baked as one larger piece, with crust outside and crumb inside.",
      "targetId": "L",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-3-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-3",
      "text": "Shape and swirl—A-B-C!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-3-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-3",
      "text": "Bakery pictures, name with me!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-M",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "Macaron? Yes—M. Macaron in our sight | outline and surface make the clue feel right",
      "targetId": "M",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-N",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "along the morning bakery display, the N clue is Napoleon Pastry. A Napoleon pastry shows many thin flaky pastry layers separated by cream or filling.",
      "targetId": "N",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-O",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "Say O, then Oat Cookie. It is a flat cookie with visible oat flakes or rough oat texture on the surface.",
      "targetId": "O",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-P",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "Look—P! Look—Pretzel! It is a baked bread item twisted into a distinctive looped knot shape.",
      "targetId": "P",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Q",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "Q lands on Quiche. Quiche in our sight | outline and surface make the clue feel right",
      "targetId": "Q",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-R",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "Roll? Yes—R. A bread roll is a small individual bread piece with crust outside and soft crumb inside.",
      "targetId": "R",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-S",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "along the morning bakery display, the S clue is Scone. A scone is a small baked quick bread often shaped as a round, wedge, or thick disk.",
      "targetId": "S",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-T",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "Say T, then Tart. It has a shallow pastry shell with an open filling visible on top.",
      "targetId": "T",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-U",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "Look—U! Look—Ube Roll! Ube Roll baked in view | crust and shape become the clue",
      "targetId": "U",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-V",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "V lands on Victoria Sponge. Victoria sponge has two sponge-cake layers with jam and cream or buttercream between them.",
      "targetId": "V",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-W",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "Waffle? Yes—W. Waffle on display | little grid marks cross it every way",
      "targetId": "W",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-X",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "along the morning bakery display, the X clue is Xmas Cookie. An Xmas cookie is a shaped or decorated cookie identified by its outline and surface decoration.",
      "targetId": "X",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Y",
      "sectionId": "r1-y-z",
      "text": "Say Y, then Yule Log. Yule Log in our sight | layer, crumb, or topping gives the clue just right",
      "targetId": "Y",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Z",
      "sectionId": "r1-y-z",
      "text": "Look—Z! Look—Zucchini Bread! It is a quick-bread loaf with a crust outside and soft crumb containing grated zucchini.",
      "targetId": "Z",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-7-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-7",
      "text": "Shape and swirl—A-B-C!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-7-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-7",
      "text": "Bakery pictures, name with me!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "interlude-1",
      "sectionId": "mid-interlude",
      "text": "The storybook bakery window goes still. One warm chord—then the picture names return.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
